x; white-space: normal; \nbackground-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Cohere is excited to announce the launch of<span>&nbsp;</span></span> \n<strong style=\"color: #2e2e2e; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; \nletter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Command A+</strong> \n<span style=\"color: #2e2e2e; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: \n16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: \ninitial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">, our first mixture-of-experts model that significantly outperforms the existing Command A family. We’re making it available open-source under the Apache 2.0 license - as part of our mission to make sovereign agentic AI capabilities available to enterprise and developers alike.</span> \n<br style=\"color: #2e2e2e; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: \n2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" /> \n<br style=\"color: #2e2e2e; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: \nnormal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" /> \n<strong style=\"color: #2e2e2e; \nfont-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: \ninitial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Key highlights</strong> \n<span style=\"color: #2e2e2e; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; \nwhite-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">:</span> \n<br style=\"color: #2e2e2e; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; \norphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" /> \n<ul style=\"color: #2e2e2e; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff; \ntext-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"> \n<li>One model for reasoning, multimodal, and translation tasks</li> \n<li>Major performance gains from previous Command series</li> \n<li>Up to 2x higher inference speed</li> \n<li>Can run on as few as two Nvidia H100 GPUs<br /></li> \n</ul> \n<div style=\"color: #2e2e2e; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff; \ntext-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n If you're interested in learning more about Command A+, including detailed model performance benchmarks, technical details, and how to get started, please \n<a href=\n\"https://eml.cohere.com/MDAzLUVaTC02NzgAAAGh5XdavSFHIbdpeh3CamOdqCF7AoiZAZTe20b2y-nLGVPdUPP6yLXG87g7eucRasRVu5_vfYA=\" target=\"_blank\" id=\"\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #39594d; font-weight: bold;\"\n>read our latest blog post</a>. Additionally, the model is available for download today on \n<a href=\n\"https://eml.cohere.com/MDAzLUVaTC02NzgAAAGh5XdavaaeNbspDsdTbndFS5WgV4a2McFbnemt85HHSf7GDzo0FlWWYvYSfEaQGZtwllOwDJo=\" target=\"_blank\" id=\"\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #39594d; font-weight: bold;\"\n>Hugging 