    "text": "To view this email as a web page, go to the following address: https://go.cohere.com/index.php/email/emailWebview?mkt_tok=MDAzLUVaTC02NzgAAAGh5XdavpZIRri7DgTZw8C3jTt1xN6MiZHD-ZJC9KzMHuY8khfyflBdXQOKj-tJlbWtsbaGh3QW_UB6Agpwpck0FN2iNxExUUm_eG5RjmA\n\nCohere is excited to announce the launch of Command A+, our first mixture-of-experts model that significantly outperforms the existing Command A family. We’re making it available open-source under the Apache 2.0 license - as part of our mission to make sovereign agentic AI capabilities available to enterprise and developers alike.Key highlights:\n\n\n\t- One model for reasoning, multimodal, and translation tasks\n\t- Major performance gains from previous Command series\n\t- Up to 2x higher inference speed\n\t- Can run on as few as two Nvidia H100 GPUs\n\n\n\nIf you're interested in learning more about Command A+, including detailed model performance benchmarks, technical details, and how to get started, please read our latest blog post <https://eml.cohere.com/MDAzLUVaTC02NzgAAAGh5XdavQNCQW6jX58KCNBVip8QGeMnsf9U5DB-R8izPPp6YbiDeF2FmDswJwWLdeg9kJx0Gn4=>. Additionally, the model is available for download today on Hugging Face <https://eml.cohere.com/MDAzLUVaTC02NzgAAAGh5XdavWYbtVIXDxu-BiMDOWg88k5y3QZ6q1Vq0ClllqhulDmEeWpqmlvZ_d23TQMpmdezuC8=>, the Cohere API <https://eml.cohere.com/MDAzLUVaTC02NzgAAAGh5XdavZ5OFdDkZtnA3l79aYw1QJOmkGG6KWSBZIzXLdxEMa1wv9Qx2tVDxpAooqHfHlmJiGs=>, and Model Vault <https://eml.cohere.com/MDAzLUVaTC02NzgAAAGh5XdavUJFDMu83mspbWLyhGMpiwVzXf2DNfMd0IHgU6kPY7oHBPGqh3j69sHMd8YPO6PnDds=>.\n${CTAText}    ${CTAText}  <[[${CTAURL}]]>\n<https://eml.cohere.com/MDAzLUVaTC02NzgAAAGh5Xdavd65QtZTO1GFAv3dwA3NgKFhTsgzGER5RFlOj2nH_GyYXv7hde_wzKZD7NGCXrXwQ2Y=>     <https://eml.cohere.com/MDAzLUVaTC02NzgAAAGh5XdavelR5EoIlUTj8UVKjUfJp70-4esJeBLiCwvx1mSEc9qELW37uIrldeVw-BtHYOIpxEw=>     <https://eml.cohere.com/MDAzLUVaTC02NzgAAAGh5XdavdauIS5Hyj1oKSoKJv4dnFOl0B7a774asb8lOIHoMb6ykKjciRDI7zhiegD3mPzcTZY=>\nUnsubs